# name: follow_ball_aggressive
# description: aggressively follow the ball, predicting where it goes with the lidar when it cannot see it
# triggers: follow the ball aggressively, aggressive ball follow, chase the ball fast, track the ball, predict the ball
# plan: locate the ball (scan)@SCAN_FOR | follow — predict + lidar-track@FOLLOW_FAST
#
# Like follow_ball but with a velocity belief bridged by the LIDAR: the camera
# locks the ball, the lidar tracks it between camera frames, and it extrapolates
# along the ball's motion when unseen. Obstacle-aware move mode -- never pushes.

SET ball = SCAN_FOR("ball", 360)
IF ball != NONE THEN
    PRINT "Found the ball -- following aggressively (predict + lidar-track)."
    SET r = FOLLOW_FAST("ball", 0.7)
    PRINT "Stopped following the ball."
ELSE
    PRINT "No ball found in the room."
END
